--
--   Test Description
--   This test checks the functionality of Mode2 of the per queue rx traffic policing
--   In particular this test receives a frame and after that it receives another one 
--   right away, before the eDMA rx-rd stores the 1st frame to the memory. Since the
--   mode2 is set, the second frame will be discarded, hence no eDMA activity will be
--   performed. This is done for all 3 queues.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
